# API_PKC

This directory contains API-facing packaging for the MAMBA-NIKE submission artifacts.

NIKE was previously developed under the working name Mercury.

## Scope of this update

This update only normalizes directory layout and formal naming under `API_PKC/`.
It does **not** perform KEX interface adaptation, KAT regeneration/validation, or
algorithm-core mathematical/parameter changes.

## Target layout

```
API_PKC/
├── README
├── Implementations/
│   ├── README
│   ├── Reference_Implementation/
│   ├── Optimized_Implementation/
│   └── Additional_Implementation/
└── Test_Vectors/
```

## Formal instance set (target)

- MAMBA-NIKE-128
- MAMBA-NIKE-192
- MAMBA-NIKE-256
- MAMBA-NIKE-384
- MAMBA-NIKE-512

If a target level is not present yet in this repository snapshot, it must be
reported as a blocking issue rather than represented by placeholder instances.
